# Hub version stamp

Whenever you change any game, the hub, scores, or other player-facing files, also update the quiet stamp in `index.html`:

```html
<p class="hub-updated">Updated D MMM YYYY, HH:mm</p>
```

- Use the current local time in `UTC+8` (Hong Kong).
- Include both date and time so same-day versions can be told apart.
- Do this in the same edit as the feature/fix, even if the hub layout did not otherwise change.
